I did not add the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the approval isn't reflected in that grant. Importing `http-client` would exceed the declared authority. The grant needs updating first, and the URL would also need percent-encoding of untrusted text. The files below implement the node as granted.

